{"title": "Ilyn Toth", "pageid": 21836, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ilyn_Toth", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Humans", "Wizards", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Ilyn Toth</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Custom.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 1x, /w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Custom.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"faction\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Faction</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Red_Wizards_of_Thay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Red Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Red_Wizards_of_Thay\">Red Wizard</a></span> (possibly former)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hometown\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hometown</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonhaven\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Moonhaven\">Moonhaven</a></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"class\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Class</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Subclass</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_School\" title=\"Necromancy School\">Necromancy School</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n \n<p><b>Ilyn Toth</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Red_Wizard\">Red Wizard</a> who fled <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thay\">Thay</a> with his apprentice. He became an apothecary in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonhaven\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Moonhaven\">Moonhaven</a> sometime before Nightal of 1371 DR.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png/64px-Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png/96px-Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png/128px-Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png/64px-Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Book_Generic_A_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">Will the zulkirs find me before I can bring her back? I cannot say, but if they do come for me, they'll have to face the guardians I've raised.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"><small>— <b><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Journal\" title=\"Dark Journal\">Dark Journal</a> found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a></b></small>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Although Ilyn Toth is not encountered in the game, the party can explore his former home and store in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>. They can also find books and notes he wrote about his life and work in Moonhaven.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>While at Moonhaven, Ilyn Toth hid his tattoos and locked away his red robes, believing himself to pass as a simple healer. However, the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">druids</a> of the nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> noted reports of a red wizard that same year.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Ilyn Toth continued his necromantic research, striving for a true restoration of life rather than simple reanimation.<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> He recorded every instance of a person arriving or leaving Moonhaven, taking pains to note whether they were Thayan.<sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>He possessed the rare magical tome <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_of_Thay\" title=\"Necromancy of Thay\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_of_Thay\" title=\"Necromancy of Thay\">Necromancy of Thay</a>, which he believed contained the knowledge he needed. However, the tome resisted his attempts to unearth its secrets.<sup id=\"cite_ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>At some point, Toth reached out to the library of the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Heralds\" title=\"High Heralds\">High Heralds</a>, claiming to be a researcher with a \"casual interest\" in studying the Necromancy of Thay.<sup id=\"cite_ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> However, the library of the High Heralds denied his request for research material, correctly surmising that his motives were beyond casual interest.\n</p><p>His logbook notes that the key gem for the tome went missing on the 14th of Nightal of an unknown year. One day later, his apprentice disappears near the well. The logbook proceeds to note a raid three days later, on the 18th. On the 20th, in the last entry of the logbook, Ilyn records seeing smoke on the horizon.<sup id=\"cite_ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> He was ultimately killed during a Dark Justiciar raid led by the <a href=\"/wiki/Oathbreaker\" title=\"Oathbreaker\">Oathbreaker</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Ilyn knew and despised the lich <a href=\"/wiki/Szass_Tam\" title=\"Szass Tam\">Szass Tam</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> As the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Zulkir\">Zulkir</a> for necromancy, Tam presumably stood in the way of Toth's research.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{m